    "author_association": "NONE",
    "body": "### Contact Details (e.g. Tox ID or email)\n\n_No response_\n\n### Feature Description\n\nIt looks like the author already figures out how to select the language based on system locales:\n\nhttps://github.com/TokTok/qTox/blob/c4eba9d36732aa03f70cc97ac6d3702e15a1e223/src/widget/translator.cpp#L42-L43\n\nbut unfortunately the default settings hard-code `en` for this:\n\nhttps://github.com/TokTok/qTox/blob/c4eba9d36732aa03f70cc97ac6d3702e15a1e223/src/persistence/settings.cpp#L159\n\nIt would be great, if qtox can set the correct language upon first launch (or better, add an option to follow system language every time).\n\n### Contribution\n\n- [x] I would like to contribute to this feature",
